// power-gate) - see vendor pins_arduino.h.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO25 tagged "led_high" - confirmed onboard single-color
// LED (LED0, GPIO25, high active) per RIOT-OS board support docs
// (api.riot-os.org/esp32-heltec-lora32-v2_2include_2board_8h.html), which
// documents this exact board. Matches LED_BUILTIN/LED/DAC1/A18 aliases in
// vendor pins_arduino.h.
// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO0 tagged "button" - confirmed onboard PRG button
// (BTN0, GPIO0, low active, falling-edge) per RIOT-OS board support docs
